OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill continue dry with clear periods
OL,7,Ffor most but cloud will spread east
OL,8,Flater with rain following into the
OL,9,Fwest towards the morning. Strong winds
OL,10,Fin west with risk of coastal gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FCloudy with patchy rain in the
OL,13,Fwest but drier elsewhere with bright
OL,14,For sunny spells increasing later.
OL,15,FStrong winds, especially in the west,
OL,16,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
