OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith rain at first becoming drier and
OL,7,Fbrighter later Saturday. Sunday and
OL,8,FMonday will continue mostly dry with
OL,9,Fbright or sunny spells.
